      <data key="d3">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d4">"Ed Wood had a relationship with actor Bela Lugosi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is a 1994 American biographical period comedy-drama film directed and produced by Tim Burton. It stars Johnny Depp as the cult filmmaker Ed Wood."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is a biographical period comedy-drama film."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is a cult filmmaker portrayed by Johnny Depp."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is a filmmaker whose films featured Conrad Brooks at the beginning of Brooks's movie career."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is an American film released in 1994."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is the cult filmmaker portrayed by Johnny Depp and the subject of the film."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood is the name used to identify the subject of the text; his full name is Edward Davis Wood Jr."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood made his best-known films during the period depicted and had a relationship with actor Bela Lugosi."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood made his best-known films during the period depicted in the film."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood was directed and produced by Tim Burton."&lt;SEP&gt;"Ed Wood, also known as Edward Davis Wood Jr., was an American filmmaker, actor, writer, producer, and director. He was born on October 10, 1924, and died on December 10, 1978."&lt;SEP&gt;"The film depicts a period of Ed Wood’s life, including his filmmaking and relationship with Bela Lugosi."</data>
